  "body": "Part of #1459. The logotype is committed with generated sizes (`assets/logo/icons/`, `cargo xtask logo`), but the packaging still uses `assets/ui/cube.png`. Left for a change that may touch `scripts/`, `build.rs` or `.github/`:\n\n- Windows exe icon (embed `assets/logo/icons/camcraft.ico`; needs `build.rs` or a resource crate such as winres, a new build dependency) and the installer icon (`scripts/installer/`).\n- macOS `.icns` (`scripts/package-macos.sh` builds the iconset from `cube.png`; point it at `assets/logo/icons/`).\n- Linux desktop icon (`package-appimage.sh`, `package-linux.sh`, `package-flatpak.sh`, `package-snap.sh` copy `cube.png`).\n- The wasm shell favicon under `/app/` if it has its own page.\n\nDone means: each package carries the logotype, and `xtask/src/package_paths_tests.rs` still passes.\n",
